{
  "id": "GEN.48",
  "number": "48",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Omochakano 48",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ogosesenia Efraimu na Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba engaki magega y’ayio Yusufu ateebetigwe ng’a, “Iso nomorwaire.” Erio akaimokia abana baye babere abamura, Manase na Efraimu, bakagenda komoorora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nere ateebetigwe ng’a “Yusufu, omwana oo, ngocha are gokorora.” Erio Israeli agekomereria, akaboka, agaikaransa borere igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo agateebia Yusufu: “Nyasae Omobui nang’orokerete aaria Lusu ase ense ya Kaanani, agansesenia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aganteebia: Inche ninkomente, na oroiboro rwao robuche goika robe emeganda y’ebisaku. Ning’ee ororeeria rwao rorache korwa magega yao ense eye ebe omwando obo kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono abana bao abamura babere kwaiborerete ase ense ya Misiri ritang’ani ntaracha aa, barabwo nabaane bararokwe. Efraimu na Manase nigo barabe abaane, buna Rubeni na Simioni bare abaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bao bande baiboire magega y’aba, barabwo nabao barabe; korende nigo baratorwe ase amarieta ’abamwabo, na komenya ase omwando obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero nare korwa Padan‐Aramu, Raeli nyoko agankwera inchera gonkogenda Kaanani, ritang’ani ntaraika Efarati. Nkamotindeka agwo enchera ekogenda Efarati, nao Bethlehemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli, ekero arooche abana ba Yusufu, akamobooria: “Aba mbarabi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu akamoiraneria: “Aba nabana baane Nyasae ang’erete aiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio Israeli akamoteebia, “Bandetere aiga ase ’nde, mbasesenie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amaiso a Israeli konya abeire chinchingori ase engencho y’obogotu, tare korora buya. Igo Yusufu akamorentera abana abwo, na ere akabaagata na kobaboania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Israeli agateebia Yusufu: “Tinasemeretie ng’a kaa ninche korora obosio bwao naende, na bono Nyasae onyancheire narorire abana bao nabarabwo,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu akarusia abana korwa ase amagoro a ise, agatugama inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yusufu akabwata bonsi babere, Efraimu ase okoboko kwaye gw’okorio, akamobeka ensemo y’okobee ya Israeli, na Manase akamobwata ase okoboko kwaye gw’okobee, akamobeka ensemo y’okorio ya Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli akarambora okoboko kwaye gw’okorio, agakobeeka igoro ase omotwe o Efraimu, nonya ere orenge omoke; agakorekania amaboko aye na kobeeka okoboko kwaye gw’okobee igoro ase omotwe o Manase, nere orenge omotangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agasesenia Yusufu, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Nyasae o sokoro yane Aburaamu na o Isaka tata,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "oyio baare gotaara ase obosio bwaye;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae oyo nere ondisirie",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ase obogima bwane bwonsi goika reero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omomalaika oria ontooretie korwa ase amabe onsi, asesenie abamura aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abana aba babe bagwatorwa ase erieta riane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na ase erieta ria sokoro yane Aburaamu, na eria Isaka tata;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "tiga bakine babe abanto abange ase ense.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu agachia korora ng’a ise obekire okoboko kwaye gw’okorio igoro ase omotwe o Efraimu, ayio tayancha. Akabwata okoboko gwa ise akorusie korwa ase omotwe o Efraimu, erio akobeke ase oyo o Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu agateebia ise: “Taibo, tata, naki oyo nere omotangi; beeka okoboko kwao gw’okorio ase omotwe oye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ise akaanga, akabora: “Nimanyete, omwana one, nimanyete. Nere boigo nabe egesaku; ere boigo nabe omonene, korende oyomwabo omoke nabe omonene komobua, na oroiboro rwaye narobe egesaku kiabo ao boka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erio akabasesenia, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ekero ogosesenigwa kogokwanwa ase Abaisraeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abanto baatore amarieta aino na goteeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae abakore mobe buna Efraimu na Manase.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Agwo agwo agatang’ania Efraimu ase obosio bwa Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Israeli agateebia Yusufu: “Rora ng’ang’e inde gokwa. Nyasae nigo arabe amo nainwe, nabairanie gochia ase ense ye chisokoro chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nakomentire ensemo y’ekenyoro ekeao kobua abamino. Eyio naurete Abaamori n’omoro one, na obota bwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
